    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's time to stop Fumbling...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And time to start Freaking...</strong><br><br><i>Fumble Freaks\u00a0</i>is a 5v5 football game that blends over-the-top ragdoll chaos with classic gridiron strategy. Whether you're diving for a wobbly pass, tumbling into the end zone, or watching your perfectly planned play dissolve into mayhem, every match is a highlight reel waiting to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc8 FEATURES \ud83c\udfc8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hilariously Chaotic Football</strong> \u2013 Experience a fresh take on the sport with exaggerated physics, simplified mechanics, and non-stop action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer &amp; Multiplayer Exhibition</strong> \u2013 Compete <u>with</u> or <u>against</u> your friends in head-to-head matchups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Own Playbook</strong> \u2013 Customize your strategy before each game and create the perfect lineup of ridiculous (but effective?) plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season Mode &amp; Progression</strong> \u2013 Compete for trophies, unlock new plays, and climb the ranks as you lead your team to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetic Customization</strong> \u2013 Deck out your squad with <i>freaky</i> accessories, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the most ridiculous, physics-driven football experience ever!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's time to stop Fumbling...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And time to start Freaking...</strong><br><br><i>Fumble Freaks\u00a0</i>is a 5v5 football game that blends over-the-top ragdoll chaos with classic gridiron strategy. Whether you're diving for a wobbly pass, tumbling into the end zone, or watching your perfectly planned play dissolve into mayhem, every match is a highlight reel waiting to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc8 FEATURES \ud83c\udfc8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hilariously Chaotic Football</strong> \u2013 Experience a fresh take on the sport with exaggerated physics, simplified mechanics, and non-stop action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer &amp; Multiplayer Exhibition</strong> \u2013 Compete <u>with</u> or <u>against</u> your friends in head-to-head matchups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Own Playbook</strong> \u2013 Customize your strategy before each game and create the perfect lineup of ridiculous (but effective?) plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season Mode &amp; Progression</strong> \u2013 Compete for trophies, unlock new plays, and climb the ranks as you lead your team to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetic Customization</strong> \u2013 Deck out your squad with <i>freaky</i> accessories, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the most ridiculous, physics-driven football experience ever!</p>",
